sequenceDiagram
  participant Dev as Developer
  participant GA as GitHub Actions
  participant STS as AWS STS
  participant S3 as S3 revision bucket
  participant CD as CodeDeploy
  participant EC2 as EC2 fleet (agents)
  Dev->>GA: git push main
  GA->>GA: Job 1: npm ci + npm test
  GA->>STS: OIDC token (AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity)
  STS-->>GA: temporary credentials (no access keys)
  GA->>S3: upload myapp/COMMIT_SHA.zip
  GA->>CD: create-deployment (Env=prod, OneAtATime)
  loop each instance, one at a time
    CD->>EC2: new revision available
    EC2->>S3: agent downloads zip
    EC2->>EC2: Stop, Install, AfterInstall, Start, ValidateService
    EC2-->>CD: success / failure
  end
  CD-->>GA: deployment succeeded (or auto rollback)
